# Default-deny: only packaging inputs and application source enter the build.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!tradingagents/
!tradingagents/**
!cli/
!cli/**
# Never include private/generated files, even inside an allowed source tree.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
**/*.db
**/reports/
**/.codex/
**/auth.json
